  "message": "Sure thing! Here’s a quick rundown:\n\n**Cloud SDK tool**  \nThe Cloud SDK (Software Development Kit) is a collection of command‑line tools and libraries for interacting with cloud platforms—most commonly the Google Cloud SDK. It includes utilities like `gcloud`, `gsutil`, and `bq` that let you manage resources, run queries, upload files, and automate cloud‑based workflows from your terminal or scripts. It’s handy for provisioning services, deploying code, and scripting routine admin tasks.\n\n**Our finance‑analysis team**  \n| Agent / Role | What they do |\n|--------------|--------------|\n| **mapper_cash** | Finds cash‑payment vendor patterns (method = “CASH”). |\n| **mapper_card** | Finds card‑swipe vendor patterns (method = “CARD”). |\n| **mapper_bank** | Finds ACH/online‑transfer patterns (method = “BANK”). |\n| **mapper_other** | Catches everything else – paper checks, uncategorized items (method = “OTHER”). |\n| **synthesizer** | Merges the four mapper reports and flags missed bills, amount anomalies, and new recurring candidates. |\n| **receipt_scanner** | Scans receipt images, matches them to expense rows, and finds orphaned or mislabeled receipts. |\n| **expense_reconciler** | Finds expense rows without matching receipts (excluding known receipt‑less transactions). |\n| **progress_check** | Read‑only tool that reports which analyses have already run and how fresh they are. |\n\n**What we’re working on**  \nOur goal is to keep the company’s spending transparent and accurate by:\n\n1. Mapping all transactions (cash, card, bank, other) to build detailed expense reports.  \n2. Scanning and reconciling receipts so every expense is documented.  \n3. Synthesizing the mapper outputs to spot missed or duplicate bills, unusual amounts, and new recurring expenses.  \n4. Providing up‑to‑date status reports so stakeholders can budget, forecast, and stay compliant.\n\nLet me know if you’d like more detail on any of these agents or if you’d like to run a specific analysis!",
